{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788705116365,"sessionID":"ses_f88de0697ffeJyEgaxJWCC7F93","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-93f32cf9c6f6612e","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"gh issue view 167"},"output":"title:\tImplement @(path) module-as-function routing-arm syntax\nstate:\tOPEN\nauthor:\tkantord (Dániel Kántor)\nlabels:\t\ncomments:\t0\nassignees:\t\nprojects:\t\nmilestone:\t\nissue-type:\t\nparent:\t\nsub-issues:\t\nsub-issues-completed:\t\nblocked-by:\t\nblocking:\t\nnumber:\t167\n--\nRuled in the module-routing-and-erlang-target grilling round (question module-as-function-routing-design): option C chosen, a dedicated routing-arm form for matcher arms dispatching to a submodule file, spelled @(route-groups/baz.toy) (parenthesized, per maintainer refinement of the round's bare @path). See plans/module-routing-research.md for the full syntax survey. Depends on per-file visibility tracking landing first (tracked separately).\n","metadata":{"output":"title:\tImplement @(path) module-as-function routing-arm syntax\nstate:\tOPEN\nauthor:\tkantord (Dániel Kántor)\nlabels:\t\ncomments:\t0\nassignees:\t\nprojects:\t\nmilestone:\t\nissue-type:\t\nparent:\t\nsub-issues:\t\nsub-issues-completed:\t\nblocked-by:\t\nblocking:\t\nnumber:\t167\n--\nRuled in the module-routing-and-erlang-target grilling round (question module-as-function-routing-design): option C chosen, a dedicated routing-arm form for matcher arms dispatching to a submodule file, spelled @(route-groups/baz.toy) (parenthesized, per maintainer refinement of the round's bare @path). See plans/module-routing-research.md for the full syntax survey. Depends on per-file visibility tracking landing first (tracked separately).\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"gh issue view 167","time":{"start":1788705116341,"end":1788705116358}},"id":"prt_077220c43001LRpPWifhk5al6r","sessionID":"ses_f88de0697ffeJyEgaxJWCC7F93","messageID":"msg_07721fd1c001l9VfMizpPAmWPW"}}
