 work. Let me also check what gh:166 landed (the file-visibility tracking), which is the prerequisite.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_077222a04001JkwRrMA6OU2YP7","sessionID":"ses_f88de0697ffeJyEgaxJWCC7F93","messageID":"msg_077221d94001BugxVD2o0aa5sX"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788705123632,"sessionID":"ses_f88de0697ffeJyEgaxJWCC7F93","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_e511e7a88f184908bacd35b4","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"gh issue view 166"},"output":"title:\tChecker: track per-file definition origin and enforce visibility\nstate:\tOPEN\nauthor:\tkantord (Dániel Kántor)\nlabels:\t\ncomments:\t0\nassignees:\t\nprojects:\t\nmilestone:\t\nissue-type:\t\nparent:\t\nsub-issues:\t\nsub-issues-completed:\t\nblocked-by:\t\nblocking:\t\nnumber:\t166\n--\nPrerequisite named by the module-as-function-routing-design ruling (module-routing-and-erlang-target grilling round): the checker does not currently track which file a definition came from, and cannot enforce visibility per call site. This already blocks a pub prelude function from calling a private one, and blocks any module-dispatch syntax (see #162) from meaning anything. Scope: checker tracks origin file per definition; enforces that a non-pub definition is only callable from its own file.\n","metadata":{"output":"title:\tChecker: track per-file definition origin and enforce visibility\nstate:\tOPEN\nauthor:\tkantord (Dániel Kántor)\nlabels:\t\ncomments:\t0\nassignees:\t\nprojects:\t\nmilestone:\t\nissue-type:\t\nparent:\t\nsub-issues:\t\nsub-issues-completed:\t\nblocked-by:\t\nblocking:\t\nnumber:\t166\n--\nPrerequisite named by the module-as-function-routing-design ruling (module-routing-and-erlang-target grilling round): the checker does not currently track which file a definition came from, and cannot enforce visibility per call site. This already blocks a pub prelude function from calling a private one, and blocks any module-dispatch syntax (see #162) from meaning anything. Scope: checker tracks origin file per definition; enforces that a non-pub definition is only callable from its own file.\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"gh issue view 166","time":{"start":1788705123625,"end":1788705123629}},"id":"prt_077222a1d