eive, pattern matching) against real `erl`/`erlc` output, not just written docs. Prior attempt (erlang-target-research run 1) hit a sandbox denial trying `which erl`/`erl -eval` and gave up; that incident is logged in plans/opencode-rollout.md -- this is an infrastructure-level restriction, so brief this run to document the denial precisely and stop rather than retry through another channel if it recurs. Write findings as an addendum to plans/erlang-target-research.md.'\n  kind: build\n  needs: []\n  prio: 4\n  status: todo\n\n- id: variant-checker-capital-first\n  issue: gh:156","lineStart":220,"lineEnd":249,"totalLines":489,"truncated":true}},"title":"plans/board.yaml","time":{"start":1788705212391,"end":1788705212399}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_0772387e3001ib40kFN3l0f0Be","sessionID":"ses_f88de0697ffeJyEgaxJWCC7F93","messageID":"msg_0772382340012kF5XZdpQlo3jI"}}
