{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788705329747,"sessionID":"ses_f88de0697ffeJyEgaxJWCC7F93","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_da831c1252f04865bcdb8707","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n \"DECIDED|module\" draft.md | head -20"},"output":"873:### UNDECIDED: what to call the record-forming update\n1033:## DECIDED: Int is 32 bits and wraps\n1326:## DECIDED: records can be built, and a record is how several arguments travel\n1449:## DECIDED: a minimal cut of streaming input, pull-based, one new keyword\n1572:## DECIDED: one stdin source is the destination\n1584:## DECIDED: `inputs`, eager, not an answer to Q1 either\n1634:## DECIDED: `jsonlines`, and the jq tutorial reproduces in full\n1671:## DECIDED: `f x` reads as `f(x)`, but only where an expression begins fresh\n1735:## DECIDED: a rudimentary module system, one prelude file and `pub`\n1765:`prelude.toy` is parsed as a module -- `parse::parse_module`, a second entry point next to\n1767:real, checked-in file meant to be read: a module is zero or more `[pub] fn` definitions and\n1802:## DECIDED: record fields keep their declared order\n1815:## DECIDED: record field order is not type identity\n1838:## DECIDED: Stream is the effect layer, typed\n1932:## DECIDED: Float is JavaScript's double\n1948:## DECIDED: match arms compose with `or`, and a guard chain may be honestly partial\n2000:## DECIDED: enums, nominal and JSON-native\n2112:## DECIDED: equality on a composite is structural, and stops at a Vec\n","metadata":{"output":"873:### UNDECIDED: what to call the record-forming update\n1033:## DECIDED: Int is 32 bits and wraps\n1326:## DECIDED: records can be built, and a record is how several arguments travel\n1449:## DECIDED: a minimal cut of streaming input, pull-based, one new keyword\n1572:## DECIDED: one stdin source is the destination\n1584:## DECIDED: `inputs`, eager, not an answer to Q1 either\n1634:## DECIDED: `jsonlines`, and the jq tutorial reproduces in full\n1671:## DECIDED: `f x` reads as `f(x)`, but only where an expression begins fresh\n1735:## DECIDED: a rudimentary module system, one prelude file and `pub`\n1765:`prelude.toy` is parsed as a module -- `parse::parse_module`, a second entry point next to\n1767:real, checked-in file meant to be read: a module is zero or more `[pub] fn` definitions and\n1802:## DECIDED: record fields keep their declared order\n1815:## DECIDED: record field order is not type identity\n1838:## DECIDED: Stream is the effect layer, typed\n1932:## DECIDED: Float is JavaScript's double\n1948:## DECIDED: match arms compose with `or`, and a guard chain may be honestly partial\n2000:## DECIDED: enums, nominal and JSON-native\n2112:## DECIDED: equality on a composite is structural, and stops at a Vec\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"rg -n \"DECIDED|module\" draft.md | head -20","time":{"start":1788705329743,"end":1788705329745}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let me look at draft.md around line  ̃1765 for the DECIDED module section.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_077255246001jnrj4c3gwlB0Oc","sessionID":"ses_f88de0697ffeJyEgaxJWCC7F93","messageID":"msg_07725454b001o0fMhAyRxgKAbx"}}
