.enums, &t.ty));\nsrc/emit_llvm.rs:1702:                    Type::Enum { .. } => ty::variants(self.enums, &subject.ty),\nsrc/emit_llvm.rs:2581:                let descriptor = self.string_const(&descriptor(self.enums, elem_ty));\nsrc/emit_llvm.rs:2724:    let mut e = Emitter::new(ctx, &program.enums);\nsrc/emit_llvm.rs:2756:        let descriptor = e.string_const(&descriptor(&program.enums, ty));\nsrc/emit_js.rs:229:    let enums = &program.enums;\nsrc/emit_js.rs:334:    let enums = &program.enums;\n","metadata":{"output":"src/emit_toylang.rs:150:    for decl in decls_in_source_order(&file.aliases, &file.enums, &file.defs) {\nsrc/emit_toylang.rs:162:    let decls = decls_in_source_order(&[], &module.enums, &module.defs);\nsrc/emit_py.rs:268:    let enums = &program.enums;\nsrc/emit_py.rs:392:    let enums = &program.enums;\nsrc/emit_py.rs:948:            show_enum(&program.enums, &ty, \"v\", 0)\nsrc/emit_rs.rs:634:        registry: &program.enums,\nsrc/emit_rs.rs:658:        collect_wire(&program.enums, ty, &mut wire);\nsrc/emit_rs.rs:663:        collect_wire(&program.enums, ty, &mut wire);\nsrc/emit_rs.rs:669:        registry: &program.enums,\nsrc/emit_rs.rs:690:    for (i, en) in e.enums.iter().enumerate() {\nsrc/emit_rs.rs:694:        let variants = ty::variants(&program.enums, en);\nsrc/emit_rs.rs:894:                if self.enums.contains(t) {\nsrc/emit_rs.rs:897:                self.enums.push(t.clone());\nsrc/emit_rs.rs:1022:        self.enums\nsrc/emit_lua.rs:468:    let enums = &program.enums;\nsrc/emit_lua.rs:554:    let enums = &program.enums;\nsrc/emit_lua.rs:708:            show_enum(&program.enums, &ty, \"v\", 0)\nsrc/emit_jq.rs:125:    let enums = &program.enums;\nsrc/emit_jq.rs:980:        |ty| printer_deps(&program.enums, ty),\nsrc/emit_jq.rs:988:            canonical_enum(&program.enums, &ty, \".\")\nsrc/emit_llvm.rs:1146:        let variants = ty::variants(self.enums, ty);\nsrc/emit_llvm.rs:1249:        let tag = ty::variants(self.enums, ty)\nsrc/emit_llvm.rs:1429:                let descriptor = self.string_const(&descriptor(self.enums, elem));\nsrc/emit_llvm.rs:1458:                        let descriptor = self.string_const(&descriptor(self.enums, &t.ty));\nsrc/emit_llvm.rs:1702:                    Type::Enum { .. } => ty::variants(self.enums, &subject.ty),\nsrc/emit_llvm.rs:2581:                let descriptor = self.string_const(&descriptor(self.enums, elem_ty));\nsrc/emit_llvm.rs:2724:    let mut e = Emitter::new(ctx, &program.enums);\nsrc/emit_llvm.rs:2756:        let descriptor = e.string_const(&descriptor(&program.enums, ty));\nsrc/emit_js.rs:229:    let enums = &program.enums;\nsrc/emit_js.rs:334:    let enums = &program.enums;\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"rg -n \"program.enums|\\.enums\\b\" src/emit_*.rs src/input.rs src/offload.rs src/tags.rs | head -30","time":{"start":1788705340245,"end":1788705340247}},"id":"prt_077257b4a001Uk6UTcd7vUl8JN","sessionID":"ses_f88de0697ffeJyEgaxJWCC7F93","messageID":"msg_077255f63001bKeFjtdV5naqxy"}}
